st-rename real-path escape detection refuses to\nconfirm any write that landed outside the repository (bytes unlinked\nbest-effort). The residual single-write race is documented in the code as\naccepted within the single-operator local threat model. Regression pin\ncovers the deterministic surface: pre-swapped junction rejection, ordinary\nwrite completion, detection wiring presence, and the absence of any false\nhandle-pin mechanism. control 42/42, npm test 417/417.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Pi GUI Mobile Agent <noreply@local>","timestamp":"2026-11-26T12:24:03Z","author":{"name":"HYJ1817","email":"hyjsb1817@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"HYJ1817","email":"hyjsb1817@gmail.com"}},"repository":{"id":1465689328,"node_id":"R_kgDOV1yk8A","name":"pi-gui-ios","full_name":"HYJ1817/pi-gui-ios","private":false,"owner":{"login":"HYJ1817","id":173616370,"node_id":"U_kgDOClks8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173616370?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817","html_url":"https://github.com/HYJ1817","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HYJ1817/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/HYJ1817/pi-gui-ios","description":"iOS client for pi-gui — remote control for the pi coding agent","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HYJ1817/pi-gui-ios","forks_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HYJ1817/pi-gui-ios/forks","k